00:07:20.907 --> 00:07:25.077
the guy -- the prince, you know,
he thought she was dead.

00:07:25.077 --> 00:07:28.681 align:start size:94% position:6%
So it's worse than just,
"I'm gonna kiss a sleeping..."

00:07:28.681 --> 00:07:29.816 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:07:29.816 --> 00:07:31.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
